# Shared look for every GIF, sourced first by each tape. Keep it the same
# across Welsh-named tools so their READMEs and sites match. Only Set
# commands: VHS ignores Set after the first action, so a tape can still
# change its height after sourcing this, then source setup.tape.
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 10
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
